# Shell scripts and sources are executed inside a Linux VM over a Windows mount.
# A CR at the end of a line makes `set -e` an illegal option and a shebang unusable,
# and the failure reads as a shell bug rather than a line-ending one - so line endings
# are pinned rather than left to the platform. See docs/WORKLOG.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
